Test rg35 (XFAIL): a constants block that runs past the bank must still fail
// setConstPC places the implicit block and bound-checks separately from the
// directive rules and from setVarsPC, so it needs its own negative case.
// Two pooled constants starting at 07777 put the second at 010000.
100/
beg,    lac [0123]
        lac [0456]
07777/
        constants
stop
